# Outputs -- run artifacts stay local; the small v2 read-outs (md/json/log) are tracked as the
# durable record. `outputs/v*/*` (not `outputs/v*`) so the REPORTS dir can be re-included;
# *.npz above still applies inside it.
outputs/v*/*
!outputs/v2/REPORTS/

